# Refined GitHub Dark — Open Claw default
# Cooler, more cohesive take on GitHub-dark. The gruvbox-y gold (#d29922) is
# replaced by a cleaner amber (#e3b341) and the cyan is pulled toward teal so the
# whole palette leans blue/purple/cyan instead of warm yellow.
#
# Format: key=hex (no leading '#'). Parsed by scripts/utils/theme.sh (shell) and
# scripts/utils/claw-dashboard.py (python). This file is the SINGLE SOURCE OF
# TRUTH for the palette — edit here, every surface follows.
name=Refined GitHub Dark
slug=refined-dark
bg=0d1117
bg_alt=161b22
fg=c9d1d9
muted=8b949e
divider=30363d
blue=58a6ff
green=3fb950
purple=bc8cff
amber=e3b341
red=ff7b72
cyan=39c5ff
